# S07: Totem Organization Layer

## App-agent protocol

All tasks in this sprint follow `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md`.
Code tasks use `templates/PD-APP-AGENT-BLOCK.md`.

## MCP-first execution (MANDATORY on every PM task)

Docs MCP must be running: `cd docs && NUXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1 bun --bun nuxt dev` (:3000).

| Phase | Tools |
|-------|-------|
| Preflight | `explain("layer-cascade")`, `explain("<slug>")`, `list-pages`, `get-page` |
| Discover | `list-apps`, `get-file` (read before edit) |
| Verify | `census()`, `get-page` (new pages), `bun run feature:health` |
| Knowledge | `record(slug, aspect, content)` when updating slug aspects in-session |

If MCP offline → WARN user, `[static fallback]` only; note gap in sprint summary (T07).

## Objective

Move Totem **header** rules (project-agnostic governance) into app-agent **organization**
documentation layer (`docs/content/2.company/` + `organization/README.md`). Establish the
layer map so future sprints can plan per-app instances (`apps/<app>/planning/`) via
work-control — **not in this sprint**.

## Foundation decisions (frozen — see S07-INVARIANTS.md)

- **Totem header** = org handbook (governance, gates, roles, doc layers) — applies to every app
- **Totem instance** = per-app (`apps/<app>/planning/`) — documented as future target, S08+
- **Sprint home:** external totem `instances/app-agent/sprints/` (work-control unchanged)
- **No code paths** changed in work-control this sprint

